# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deny by default.
#
# This repo holds ~/.claude, which also contains OAuth credentials, full
# conversation transcripts, session state and a ~1 GB plugin cache. Rather
# than blocklisting those (and hoping the list stays current), everything is
# ignored and only curated configuration is allowed back in below.
#
# To version something new: add an explicit `!path` rule. Never remove the `*`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*

!.gitignore
!README.md

# Curated configuration
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json

!agents/
!agents/**

!commands/
!commands/**

!skills/
!skills/**

!templates/
!templates/**

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Belt and braces: these can never be tracked, whatever the rules above say.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.credentials.json
**/.credentials.json
**/settings.local.json
**/*.pem
**/.env
**/.env.*
